WEBVTT

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:14.770
<i>Glen...</i>

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:18.950
Nice, Reika.

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:20.980
You, too, Glen.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:24.210
<i>One day, I will successfully Merge and...</i>

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:28.880
Doctor?

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:39.020
<i>I've brought misfortune again...</i>

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:49.110
<i>On the first day of the world,</i> <i>under the Tree of Life,</i>

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:55.450
<i>the two of us heard the voices of whales,</i> <i>reverberating from afar.</i>

00:00:55.450 --> 00:01:01.790
<i>With all that we have lost,</i> <i>and all that we have loved</i>

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:08.460
<i>embraced in our arms,</i> <i>where will we wander off to now?</i>

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:14.800
<i>The answer lies in the amber sun.</i>

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:21.140
<i>If I had never met you,</i>
<i>I would have been a destroying angel.</i>

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:26.820
<i>My soul possessed of</i> <i>a twinkling of immortality,</i>

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:30.150
<i>do not wound my wings.</i>

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:37.160
<i>I was born to know this feeling.</i>

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:43.500
<i>For ten thousand years</i> <i>and two thousand more, I've loved you.</i>

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:49.840
<i>After eight thousand years,</i>
<i>I loved you even more.</i>

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:56.180
<i>For another hundred million years</i> <i>and two thousand more, I'll still love you.</i>

00:01:56.180 --> 00:02:04.980
<i>From the first day I knew you,</i> <i>the music in my hell has never stopped.</i>

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:36.140
What's that?

00:02:57.670 --> 00:02:59.330
Don't worry about it too much.

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:04.510
Glen is strong.
I'm sure he'll regain consciousness.

00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:11.510
<i>Sempai</i>?

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:18.360
What card is that?

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:23.190
A turning point of fate.

00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:37.340
Oh dear! Now we won't be able to get back to the dorm!

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:40.520
This must've surely been because of your misfortune!

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:41.510
Slivie!

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:17.250
C-Commander!

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:25.420
Eyes as clear as a bubbling spring...

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:33.470
But this water cannot be made into tea.

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:36.460
Not until the ripples of fear and doubt subside.

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:03.290
Brother...

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:09.470
I wonder how Reika was related to Aquarion in her previous life.

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:10.630
I don't know.

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:15.640
But what is certain is that she is a highly capable Element.

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:17.980
Oh? Do you really think so?

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:22.150
Not once did any battle go well with her aboard!

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:26.490
During our first trial, when we successfully did a Merge...

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:30.320
Reika piloted the head.

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:33.560
Brother...

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:37.660
<i>Do you want to Merge</i> <i>with that woman again?!</i>

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:51.480
Can I sleep in your room tonight?

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:53.510
Goodness, you are such a child...

00:05:56.950 --> 00:05:58.940
<i>Sempai</i> sure is late...

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:07.520
Welcome home, <i>Sempai</i>!

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:17.030
This can't be!

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:25.140
You've got skills...

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:32.150
All that's left is to insert this here...

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:38.190
It's done!

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:39.990
Way to go, Jun!

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:41.260
I knew you could do it!

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:42.790
It's nothing...

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:46.870
Reika, give it a try.

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:49.770
Me? But...

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:51.330
You'll do fine. Go ahead.

00:06:57.380 --> 00:06:59.110
<i>Sempai</i>, it'll be fine.

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:05.750
--What happened?
--A power outage?

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:07.280
N-No way...

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:11.090
The monitor, it's...

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:18.860
N-Nooo!

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:33.710
I can't take it anymore!

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:40.460
Were they ghosts?

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:43.120
G-Ghosts? I don't believe in ghosts!

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:52.370
I'm so sorry! My blast caused this!

00:07:52.370 --> 00:07:55.460
No, it's all because of my misfortune...

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:09.350
"I won't be coming back.
Please don't look for me. Reika."

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:23.350
What're you doing here so early in the morning?

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:29.100
Cripes! I caught nothing today.

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:30.570
Caught?

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.340
Caught what, Apollo?

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:35.340
I was out hunting for food.

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:39.550
Huh? They serve food at Deava.

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:42.180
That's not enough.

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:45.050
I want to eat fresher things.

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:48.680
My gosh! You mean you catch and eat animals?

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:52.250
That's how I've survived until now.

00:08:56.860 --> 00:09:00.860
If we hadn't met here, you might have caught something.

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:07.870
I bring misfortune.

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:12.710
What're you talking about?

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:17.050
I lost in a contest with my prey, that's all.

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:37.370
Looks like you are the reason I couldn't catch anything, after all.

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:42.080
Your scent carried all the way into the valley.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:45.170
No wonder I couldn't find even a single mouse.

00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:52.340
I see... it carried on this breeze...

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:52.050
One day, when I'm able to Merge,

00:10:52.050 --> 00:10:54.380
I definitely want it to be with you...

00:10:57.250 --> 00:10:58.740
Uh, with the two of you!

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:08.660
...this water cannot be made into tea.

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:20.010
High-level quantum readings detected in the vicinity of Lake Los,

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:23.340
Sirius, Silvia, Reika!
Prepare immediately for launch!

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:27.010
Vector Mars, taking off!

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:30.210
Vector Luna, taking off!

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.690
I'm going in Reika's place!

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:36.760
What?! Why is Apollo flying this mission?!

00:11:36.760 --> 00:11:39.390
Reika! Where is Reika?!

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:41.030
I found this...

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:42.550
in Reika's quarters.

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:47.360
"Please don't look for me?!"

00:11:58.550 --> 00:12:00.710
Prana... from the lake?

00:12:11.890 --> 00:12:12.890
What in the world?

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:14.660
The train has made an abrupt stop.

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:16.900
We are currently attempting to determine the cause.

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:21.240
Passengers, please wait and remain inside the train.

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:22.570
<i>I sense something terrible...</i>

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:32.400
The Vectors!

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:39.580
What're they doing here?

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:52.100
I left Deava so everyone wouldn't be caught up in my misfortune.

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:54.500
So why?

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:56.060
Why?!

00:12:57.770 --> 00:12:59.270
What's going on?

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:02.440
There isn't a single Cherubim, much less a Harvest Beast.

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:03.940
Keep your guard up!

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:04.930
Shut up!

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:08.610
Something about that train bothers me...

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:10.950
--We're turning back!
--Roger!

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:17.110
I've got to get away from here quickly!

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:24.620
That's...

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:28.300
The construction site near the lake...

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:30.130
...is showing abnormal high-level quantum readings!

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:35.080
Something's wrong!

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:39.010
Lake volume is five times larger than last month's data!

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:40.380
Five times?!

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:43.850
I estimate there is a Mythic Beast beneath the surface.

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:48.220
All right. Merge immediately with Sirius as the head!

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:49.210
Roger!

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:54.820
I've got to get away before misfortune befalls everyone!

00:13:57.160 --> 00:13:58.150
Aquarion!

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:01.320
What the-?!

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:04.240
This can't be! We can't Merge!

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:05.500
What is this?!

00:14:11.010 --> 00:14:13.000
The Merge Shield was compromised!

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.280
Oh my god...

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:21.680
I'm freezing...

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:27.030
But Vector is still maintaining normal cabin temperature.

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:29.660
Then why is she feeling so cold?

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:33.330
Hey Silvia, maybe you're just the cold type?

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:34.600
I am not!

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:37.600
Didn't that warm you up a bit?

00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:41.940
I'm not kidding!
I'm really freezing.

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:44.940
I can't move!

00:14:46.050 --> 00:14:49.580
All Vector control systems malfunctioning.

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:51.290
They've lost control!

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:55.620
What're you waiting for?!
Get it fixed asap!

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:57.790
I can't control my body!

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:59.730
Any longer and they're in serious danger!

00:14:59.730 --> 00:15:02.560
Commander, you must order a change immediately!

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:05.270
We can't! The teleporter system is offline!

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:06.070
What's causing it?

00:15:06.070 --> 00:15:07.060
Unknown!

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:12.670
It's no use...

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:18.340
Huh? What's this?

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:22.750
<i>It carried on this breeze...</i>

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:24.580
She's... very near!

00:15:30.790 --> 00:15:32.260
Reika!

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:34.760
What're you doing here?!

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:35.750
<i>Sempai</i>!

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:40.600
Reika... why're you here?

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:45.170
Don't tell me we're in this mess because of you?!

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:49.800
I'm sorry... I never meant to bring you all misfortune.

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:53.940
<i>What's at the bottom of the lake?</i>

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:56.950
<i>I mustn't!</i>

00:15:56.950 --> 00:16:01.950
<i>Each time I try to do something,</i>
<i>I bring misfortune.</i>

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:08.820
I'm sorry!

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:17.630
<i>Sempai</i>!

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:20.970
Good god...

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:24.240
Look!

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:25.440
<i>Sempai</i>!

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:31.650
More misfortune...

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:34.650
Is that what you call misfortune?!

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:50.140
Misfortune, misfortune- that's all you talk about!

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:51.660
What?

00:16:55.980 --> 00:17:01.350
All of you simply don't see your own misfortune!

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:02.680
Misfortune?!

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:06.180
What's misfortune got to do with this?!

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:11.350
Show us how "misfortunate" you really are!

00:17:17.700 --> 00:17:21.440
<i>Yes, if I can't escape from it...</i>

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:24.200
<i>I'll show you just how</i> <i>misfortunate I really am!</i>

00:17:42.690 --> 00:17:43.680
<i>Sirius!</i>

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:51.320
<i>Sirius... wait for me...</i>
<i>I will do this...</i>

00:17:56.070 --> 00:17:58.070
The lake is changing more violently!

00:17:58.070 --> 00:17:59.410
The lake is?!

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:02.400
Lake high-level quantum levels rising!

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:13.680
I can move!

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:21.350
Those children were at the bottom of the lake...

00:18:23.360 --> 00:18:24.520
They're still alive!

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:26.260
Reika!

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:30.600
Show me your misfortune.

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:32.940
If you regret it, don't say I didn't warn you.

00:18:32.940 --> 00:18:34.980
That's what I was hoping for!

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:36.440
So, what's our enemy?

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:38.880
The lake itself is a Mythic Beast.

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:42.120
Many people have become victims that serve as sources of Prana.

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:47.790
What?! You mean we're in the enemy's belly?!

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:51.560
Sounds like fun!
Let's chew out its guts!

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:52.790
Let's.

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:53.860
Where's Brother?

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:57.330
Don't worry.
I'll rescue him for sure.

00:18:57.330 --> 00:18:58.320
Reika...

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:04.300
We have to hurry.

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:14.280
The lake is floating in mid-air!

00:19:14.280 --> 00:19:18.150
Oh no! It's trying to escape with the Vectors still inside!

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:21.660
Reika's high-level quantum levels reading irregular fluctuations!

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:25.290
Reika's Merge success ratio is 17.2 percent!

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:26.620
This isn't going to work!

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.670
The old pond is full...

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:34.170
Let's do it!

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:35.440
Gattai!

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:37.170
Go! Aquarion!

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:43.400
Is this Reika's...

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:46.410
Creepy!

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:52.610
Turn my pain, my sadness into Aquarion's power!

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:55.020
Reika...

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:57.510
Do you always feel such pain?

00:19:58.530 --> 00:20:01.190
Aquarion... Punch!

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:08.200
Break through the bottom of the tub!

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:15.000
Feel the nadir of misfortune!
Deathblow! Unlucky Bottom Attack!

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:17.500
"Unlucky Bottom Attack!"

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:30.280
We're breaking through the bottom of the tub!

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:53.250
You did it...

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:54.580
You're good...

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:58.750
Thank you, Apollo, Silvia.

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:04.750
We did it without losing any lives...

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:16.770
Brother...

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:18.260
We won!

00:21:30.120 --> 00:21:34.450
I'm sure he'll be happier than anyone...

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:37.290
...that you were able to Merge once again.

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:38.450
Yes.

00:21:44.800 --> 00:21:45.790
Glen?

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:51.810
What happened to patient Glen?

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:53.300
Glen?

00:21:55.480 --> 00:22:00.970
He was transferred today to the
New United Nations Medical Center.

00:23:43.750 --> 00:23:46.750
<i>I feel awkward doing the preview again.</i>

00:23:46.750 --> 00:23:49.920
<i>You're wonderful at everything, Brother.</i>

00:23:49.920 --> 00:23:51.090
<i>Do you think so?</i>

00:23:51.090 --> 00:23:54.430
<i>Next on</i> Aquarion: "The Time of Amber"

00:23:54.430 --> 00:24:04.430
<i>We'll Merge next week, too.</i>
